      "alt": "TQMa6x Embedded Cortex®-A9 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX6 with scalable computing and graphics power.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa6x is an embedded Cortex®-A9 module based on i.MX6, offering scalable computing and graphics power for a wide range of applications. It comes equipped with security functions, IEEE 1588 support, and an extended temperature range. With low power consumption, it's an energy-efficient solution for embedded systems. The integrated graphic controller supports Full HD displays, making it ideal for HMI, animated displays, and multitouch applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:46:19 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
